Cody
Several of Cody's moves in Alpha 3 are unique. Other than Vega, he is the only character who can utilize a weapon (his knife), but only after he picks it up off the ground.  His V-Ism Yoke move is like an auto-dodge. He also possesses the ability to dodge certain attacks in V-ism.  His X-Ism Final Destruction Super Move is not so much a move, but an alternate style of play that make controlling Cody more like Final Fight.  He can be directed to face away from his opponent (which means he can't block), and tapping punch and kick makes him automatically perform various combos.

